From 18cabf6db235e295bafd97a998af760e80c610fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: light DeskClock app theme

Squashed from:
- 0003-light-clock-app
- 0004-match-untinted-setting-icons
- 0005-match-delete-compound-icon
- 0007-complete-light-theme-bars-and-toolbar-icons
- 0008-keep-adjacent-light-pages-system-bars-readable

Change-Id: Ic9ea5509ce276323086e69a1460a9d4a0ae01b84

Stopwatch and timer rings: the remaining (stopwatch) and elapsed (timer) parts use one light grey track (#BDBDBD) instead of white.

Alarm, world clock and timer cards and the timer keypad keys are outlined; the bottom navigation shows the selected tab inverted (black indicator, white icon) above a 1px top line; the snackbar uses the dark inverse surface.
